# BUG-9 reproduction: clay. Unit cube [0,1]^3, outward-facing normals.
# The knife plane x+y+z=1 passes exactly through vertices 2, 4 and 5, which
# are (1,0,0), (0,1,0) and (0,0,1).  Corner vertex 1 (origin) is cut off.

v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1

# z=0 (normal 0,0,-1)
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
# z=1 (normal 0,0,+1)
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
# y=0 (normal 0,-1,0)
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
# y=1 (normal 0,+1,0)
f 4 8 7
f 4 7 3
# x=0 (normal -1,0,0)
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
# x=1 (normal +1,0,0)
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
